Arc Space by Bruno Bernard (https://github.com/eznix86/herdr-arc-space), Apache-2.0.
This layout is a fork of it. Changes: renamed to arc-ext; a bottom status bar
(machine, git branch, extension buttons); a machine context so each machine's
spaces are separate; a machine picker; Windows and Linux keys; a Firefox-style
Ctrl+Tab most-recently-used switcher; Ctrl+N / Ctrl+P in the launcher and
palette. terminals-launcher and terminals-palette are copies of Herdr's shipped
terminals layout mods (Apache-2.0) with those changes.
